      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... i keep having these really intense memories that dont feel like dreams. its like i can actually remember being in these huge marble halls in france, like the late 1700s. i remember the smell of old parchment and the feeling of being in these really intense political meetings. it's so vivid it's actually kind of scary. can u help me look up some diplomats or people from that era who had similar temperaments? i feel like i need to find someone who feels... familiar.",
